[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3467218235","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112189#issuecomment-3467218235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112189","id":3467218235,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OqY07","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-30T10:27:24Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T10:30:46Z","body":"Not sure this is on our end, we don't officially support Raspberry Pi, and this might simply be the Raspberry Pi not supporting the required features","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3467218235/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3467443218","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112189#issuecomment-3467443218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112189","id":3467443218,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OrPwS","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-30T11:14:04Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T11:14:04Z","body":"I don't know a great deal about compiling for PI, but hiulit seems to have some (unofficial) info, which goes up to 3.5.2 for their builds:\nhttps://github.com/hiulit/Unofficial-Godot-Engine-Raspberry-Pi/\n\ni.e. I'm getting the impression you would have to compile Godot yourself from source with the correct scons arguments for the CPU, or use one of hiulit's binaries, rather than use one of our release binaries.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3467443218/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3467623683","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112189#issuecomment-3467623683","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112189","id":3467623683,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Or70D","user":{"login":"efornara","id":2222938,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjI5Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2222938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara","html_url":"https://github.com/efornara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-30T11:50:45Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T11:50:45Z","body":"Sure, I can find a way to compile them. In fact, I was going to, but first I wanted to report the issue and check the status of the builds upstream. My understanding is that you suggest that I go ahead and do something specific (for https://github.com/efornara/frt).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3467623683/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3467771932","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112189#issuecomment-3467771932","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112189","id":3467771932,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OsgAc","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-30T12:33:37Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T12:39:28Z","body":"My suspicion would be the boards not supporting SSE 4.2","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3467771932/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3467775756","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112189#issuecomment-3467775756","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112189","id":3467775756,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Osg8M","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-30T12:34:44Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T12:39:37Z","body":"This is 3.x not 4.x, SSE 4.2 is 4.x only (it's also an x86 feature, this is arm)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3467775756/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3468768047","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112189#issuecomment-3468768047","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112189","id":3468768047,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OwTMv","user":{"login":"efornara","id":2222938,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjI5Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2222938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara","html_url":"https://github.com/efornara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-30T16:02:57Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T16:02:57Z","body":"My guess would be that the \"issue\" is here:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/buildroot/blob/2023.08.x/config-godot-armv7\n\nIn particular:\n\n        BR2_ARCH_HAS_TOOLCHAIN_BUILDROOT=y\n        BR2_ARCH=\"arm\"\n        BR2_NORMALIZED_ARCH=\"arm\"\n        BR2_ENDIAN=\"LITTLE\"\n        BR2_GCC_TARGET_ABI=\"aapcs-linux\"\n        BR2_GCC_TARGET_CPU=\"cortex-a57\"\n        BR2_GCC_TARGET_FPU=\"neon-fp-armv8\"\n        BR2_GCC_TARGET_FLOAT_ABI=\"hard\"\n        BR2_GCC_TARGET_MODE=\"arm\"\n        BR2_BINFMT_SUPPORTS_SHARED=y\n        BR2_READELF_ARCH_NAME=\"ARM\"\n        BR2_ARM_CPU_HAS_NEON=y\n        BR2_ARM_CPU_HAS_FPU=y\n        BR2_ARM_CPU_HAS_VFPV2=y\n        BR2_ARM_CPU_HAS_VFPV3=y\n        BR2_ARM_CPU_HAS_VFPV4=y\n        BR2_ARM_CPU_HAS_FP_ARMV8=y\n        BR2_ARM_CPU_HAS_ARM=y\n        BR2_ARM_CPU_HAS_THUMB2=y\n        BR2_ARM_CPU_ARMV8A=y\n\nAre these deliberate?  I guess @hpvb  would know (https://github.com/godotengine/buildroot/blame/2023.08.x/config-godot-armv7).\n \nI am not even sure if they are actually used when compiling Godot. I don't remember seeing any cpu-related compilation flags from scons verbose=yes. They might just sneak in when statically linking the c++ runtime.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3468768047/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3481418597","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112189#issuecomment-3481418597","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112189","id":3481418597,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Pgjtl","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T16:28:50Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T16:28:50Z","body":"@efornara these were chosen based on the RPI3 if I recall correctly. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3481418597/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3481610018","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112189#issuecomment-3481610018","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112189","id":3481610018,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PhSci","user":{"login":"efornara","id":2222938,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjI5Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2222938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara","html_url":"https://github.com/efornara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T17:09:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T17:09:52Z","body":"@hpvb OK, thanks.\n\nWhen it comes to Godot 3, the (recompiled) templates run fine on a lower-end device. Both H3 and Pi2 can handle a simple UI / 2D game at 60 fps. I did run the editor on the H3 (1G RAM, Mali 400). it was sloggish, but the reimport of the assets was fine and it was possible to navigate the project to change a couple of settings (i.e. disable the 3D directional light, remove the procedural sky). 3D turned out to be unusable for the game (15 fps at 960x540), but the editor rendered the 3D viewport without artifacts.\n\nWhen it comes to Godot 4, the Pi 3 cannot run it in practice (it's ES 2 only).\n\nI don't know how it all fits with priorities, schedules, etc... but to me it would make sense to consider downgrading the baseline for arm32. If upstream is open to it, I could try to fork/recreate the buildroot, do a few tests and report back in, I guess, 1-2 weeks.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3481610018/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3482848109","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112189#issuecomment-3482848109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112189","id":3482848109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PmAtt","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T22:24:20Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T22:24:20Z","body":"@efornara I'd be happy to reduce the armv7 (32bit) specs a bit. But I do want it to target a specific other chip. The current flags were chosen because that is what the features are that the rpi3 has. \n\nI don't just want to disable all features, as these chips already need all the help they can get.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3482848109/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3482983805","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112189#issuecomment-3482983805","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112189","id":3482983805,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Pmh19","user":{"login":"efornara","id":2222938,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjI5Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2222938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara","html_url":"https://github.com/efornara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T23:16:05Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T23:16:05Z","body":"I might sound biased, but, if you want to target a specific CPU, my vote would be Cortex-A7 (in both the first Pi 2 and in the H3). Pi 2 gives you brand recognition, and H3(-like) SOCs give you cheap. Pi 0/1 is too slow anyway, for sure nowadays out of the box.\n\nIIRC, a somehow popular (and expensive) nvidia board didn't support neon, pretty much everybody else did. So, assuming you can actually make use of it, neon is probably OK to enable, but neon-fp-armv8 sounds too harsh to me. At that point, you might as well run arm64.\n\nIn any case, I can run a before and after godot 3 cpu-heavy benchmark (is there one?) on a Pi 3, if that helps.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3482983805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3487656151","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112189#issuecomment-3487656151","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112189","id":3487656151,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7P4WjX","user":{"login":"kroketio","id":114749934,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtbx7g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114749934?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kroketio","html_url":"https://github.com/kroketio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kroketio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kroketio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kroketio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kroketio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kroketio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kroketio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kroketio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kroketio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kroketio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-04T19:16:21Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T00:01:37Z","body":"Adding my findings, maybe it helps someone.\n\n- Motorola Droid 4\n- Cortex-A9 with PowerVR SGX540 GPU\n- Godot 3.6.2 (release) with the arm32 export template\n- GLES 2.0 project\n- Linux devuan-droid4 6.6.53\n\n```text\nmodel name      : ARMv7 Processor rev 3 (v7l)\nBogoMIPS        : 598.42\nFeatures        : half thumb fastmult vfp edsp thumbee neon vfpv3 tls vfpd32 \n```\n\n```bash\nuser@devuan-droid4:~/foo$ file foo.arm64.arm32\nfoo.arm64.arm32: ELF 32-bit LSB executable, ARM, EABI5 version 1 (SYSV), dynamically linked, interpreter /lib/ld-linux-armhf.so.3, for GNU/Linux 5.15.0, stripped\n\nuser@devuan-droid4:~/foo$ ./foo.arm64.arm32 \nIllegal instruction\n```\n\n```text\n(gdb) r\nStarting program: /home/user/foo/foo.arm64.arm32 \n[Thread debugging using libthread_db enabled]\nUsing host libthread_db library \"/lib/arm-linux-gnueabihf/libthread_db.so.1\".\n\nProgram received signal SIGILL, Illegal instruction.\n0x01ad31f0 in ?? ()\n(gdb) info registers\nr0             0x3804a76d          939829101\nr1             0x0                 0\nr2             0xdb40              56128\nr3             0x16                22\nr4             0xfa000000          4194304000\nr5             0x0                 0\nr6             0xfa00              64000\nr7             0xe0129             917801\nr8             0x0                 0\nr9             0xbeffe8e0          3204442336\nr10            0x1d6b000           30846976\nr11            0xbeffe8d8          3204442328\nr12            0xdb400000          3678404608\nsp             0xbeffe700          0xbeffe700\nlr             0xbeffe728          -1090525400\npc             0x1ad31f0           0x1ad31f0\ncpsr           0x200d0010          537722896\nfpscr          0x0                 0\ntpidruro       <unavailable>\n(gdb) x/4i $pc\n=> 0x1ad31f0:\tudiv\tr1, r7, r6\n   0x1ad31f4:\tmls\tr7, r6, r1, r7\n   0x1ad31f8:\tmul\tr0, r1, r5\n   0x1ad31fc:\torr\tr2, r2, r7, lsl #16\n```\n\n~~suppose I need to compile a new template with `-mno-idiv` to disable hardware integer division instructions (`UDIV`, `SDIV`) as the CPU does not support it.~~","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3487656151/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3506766793","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112189#issuecomment-3506766793","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112189","id":3506766793,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RBQPJ","user":{"login":"efornara","id":2222938,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjI5Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2222938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara","html_url":"https://github.com/efornara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/efornara/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-08T18:09:32Z","updated_at":"2025-11-08T18:09:32Z","body":"If anyone is interested, here are some builds of FRT generated with the debian default cross compilers. They have different trade-offs compared to the \"main\" binaries and they are not marked as the latest release. You have to look for them. The hope is to get a more useable arm32 binary in the future using the upstream toolchain, but these serve as a stopgap and as a comparison. It was also pretty silly that I couldn't run the official FRT binaries on some of my preferred  boards!\n\nI threw in riscv 64 binaries too, because they were trivial to add. I don't think the GPU driver situation is great, at least not in linux-mainline, but when it gets better, these might be useful to have available.\n\nI've tested the 2d/platformer on my Orange Pi PC and it runs at 60 FPS. That's the test I use to see if a binary is worth releasing. It would be interesting to see how much performance armhf (trixie) loses compared to arm32 (upstream/main) on a RPi 3. I haven't tried it yet.\n\nhttps://github.com/efornara/frt/releases/tag/3.6.2-1-trixie\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3506766793/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]